\title{勾股定理}
\language{cn}
\range{-5..5}
\author{Gang XIAO}
\email{xiao@unice.fr}
\computeanswer{yes}
\format{html}
\precision{10000}

\text{i=<i>i</i>}
\text{z1=z<sub>1</sub>}
\text{z2=z<sub>2</sub>}
\text{l1=      1,      1,      2,3, 5, 7}
\text{l2=      1,      2,      2,4,12,24}
\text{l3=sqrt(2),sqrt(5),sqrt(8),5,13,25}
\integer{n=items(\l1)}
\integer{t=random(1..\n)}
\real{n1=item(\t,\l1)}
\real{n2=item(\t,\l2)}
\text{m3=item(\t,\l3)}
\integer{exchange=random(1,2)}
\text{m1=item(\exchange,\n1,\n2)}
\text{m2=item(\exchange,\n2,\n1)}
\integer{type=random(1,2)}
\text{s1=item(\type,+,-)}
\text{s2=item(\type,-,+)}

\statement{设 \z1 和 \z2 是两个复数, 满足
|\z1|=\m1, |\z2|=\m2, |\z1\s1\z2|=\m3. 问
|\z1\s2\z2|&nbsp;等于什么?}

\answer{你的回答}{\m3}
\hint{考虑勾股定理! 辐角
Arg(\z1) 与 Arg(\z2) 之差是多少?}
